    "Source fidelity: b_up_readme_caps claims invitations, reminders, comments, notifications, and calendar conflict hints, but the host-pinned README observations cover only lines 5, 20, 23-27, 30, 33, 36, 51, and 64. README lines 29 (Invite everyone you want), 31 (automatic reminders), 32 (Comments), 34 (notifications), and 35 (calendar hints) are in the file but have no observation binding, so the statement is not traceable to quoted pinned lines.",
